{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1347592-w20-siberakh-gift-list","id":1347592,"title":"[W20] Siberakh gift list","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-10T18:52:51-08:00","id":1347592,"title":"[W20] Siberakh gift list","content":"According to the W20 core Siberakh are &quot;A combination of Silver Fang and Wendigo genetics&quot; and &quot;begin game play with 4 Willpower and may not take the Allies or Resources Backgrounds&quot; but it is never stated what gift list they use: Silver Fang? Wendigo? Both? None? Are they Ronin?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Found the lists on the page 194","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 04-15-2020, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-11T12:21:56-08:00","id":1347731,"title":"","content":"Any wendigo-silverfang gift not related directly to the tribal totems. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> SIBERAKH GIFTS<br /> This obscure, reclusive Siberian sub-tribe has<br /> little to do with the Western Concordiat, and likes<br /> it that way. Descended from a mixture of Silver Fang<br /> and Wendigo stock, the Siberakh claim Sable as their<br /> only particular spiritual ally; otherwise, they use a<br /> mixture of Wendigo and Silver Fang Gifts. Generally,<br /> Siberakh characters may purchase any Gifts from the<br /> Silver Fang and Wendigo lists except those taught by<br /> Falcon, his servants, and falcon-spirits, or by Great<br /> Wendigo and his servants. </div> </div> </div><u>Examples of ''yes''</u><br /> Wendigo: Call the Breeze (Level One), Speak with Wind Spirits (Level Two), Blood of the North (Level Three), Hero\u2019s Stand (Level Four), <br /> Silver Fangs: Lambent Flame (Level One), Luna\u2019s Armor (Level Two), Silver Claws (Level Three), Sidestep Death (Level Four), Luna\u2019s Avenger (Level Five).<br /> <br /> <u>Examples of ''no''</u><br /> Wendigo: Beat of the Heart-Drum (Level One), Cutting Wind (Level Two), Bloody Feast (Level Three), Chill of Early Frost (Level Four), Invoke the Spirits of the Storm (Level Five)<br /> Silver Fangs: Eye of the Falcon (Level One), Empathy (Level Two), Talons of the Falcon (Level Three), Mastery (Level Four), Paws of the Newborn Cub (Level Five).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}